@startuml seq-quick-paste
!include _style.iuml
title Quick Paste: hotkey to pasted text

actor User
participant "Target app" as Target
participant "HotkeyListener\n(message-only window)" as Hotkey
participant App
participant WindowHelper
participant PasteWindow
participant QuickPasteController as Ctrl
participant PasteService
participant "Clipboard\n(Win32)" as Clip

User -> Hotkey : Shift+Alt+Y (RegisterHotKey)
Hotkey -> App : HotkeyPressed
App -> WindowHelper : CaptureTargetContext()\n(remember the foreground window)
App -> PasteWindow : EnsurePasteWindow().ShowForPaste()\n(warm, prewarmed instance)
PasteWindow -> Ctrl : Open() (single-key tab, shortcut mode)
PasteWindow -> PasteWindow : install low-level hook for Alt+Esc

alt single key (shortcut mode)
  User -> PasteWindow : T
  PasteWindow -> Ctrl : SingleKey('T')
  Ctrl --> PasteWindow : PasteRequest(template)\n(DataNode.ResolveSingleKey: local first, then sync order)
else multi key
  User -> PasteWindow : Alt down
  PasteWindow -> Ctrl : AltDown() (multi-key tab, top row highlighted)
  User -> PasteWindow : T, H, X (Alt held)
  PasteWindow -> Ctrl : TypeMulti(c) (refused when no shortcut starts with it)
  User -> PasteWindow : Alt up
  PasteWindow -> Ctrl : AltUp()
  Ctrl --> PasteWindow : PasteRequest(highlighted row, plain text if '_')
else tree or list
  User -> PasteWindow : Enter / double-click / Paste As
end

PasteWindow -> PasteWindow : ExecutePaste(template, mode)\n(never in the tour)
PasteWindow -> PasteWindow : (deferred) remove hook, Close() the window
PasteWindow -> PasteService : HandlePaste(content, mode)
activate PasteService
PasteService -> Clip : snapshot the user's clipboard
PasteService -> PasteService : variables ($[DATE] ...), colours to hex,\nformats for the mode (CF_HTML / RTF / Unicode text)
PasteService -> Clip : set formats, marked transient\n(no Win+V history, no cloud clipboard)
PasteService -> WindowHelper : ForceWindowToFront(target)
PasteService -> PasteService : wait until Alt/Ctrl/Shift/Win are released,\nuntil the target is foreground again
PasteService -> Target : SendInput Ctrl+V
PasteService -> Clip : (background, after a delay) restore the snapshot
deactivate PasteService
App -> PasteWindow : Closed -> build a new warm instance (low priority)
@enduml
